      "message": "I used that approach here, if you want to take a look and see what you think: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4218924/1\n\nI need to obsolete the AMODE host commands from the zephyr tests before I can actually run this full CL stack through the CQ, but hopefully I can get that done today and get verification rolling",
      "parentUuid": "ec1c1e9d_b3a315d7",
      "revId": "8d5c8458cb7e73379b533da4e02e4dabf4773568",
